---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Obel AI & Quality"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'About', href: '/about' }]}
  description="Obel AI & Quality started as a quality and AI consultancy. Obel MS is the QMS we built after watching clients run theirs in spreadsheets."
>
  <section class="section-y pt-[calc(var(--nav-h)+3rem)]">
    <div class="container-x">
      <div class="max-w-[42rem]">
        <p class="label-dot mb-6">About Obel</p>
        <h1 class="t-h2" data-split data-split-load>Quality people who write software.</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 max-w-[38rem] flex flex-col gap-6" data-reveal-group>
        <p class="text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-muted" data-reveal>
          {site.company} started as a quality and AI consultancy. We helped small and mid-sized companies
          get ready for ISO 9001 and make sense of their data. We also automated the parts of their
          operations that didn’t need a person doing them by hand.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-muted" data-reveal>
          Client after client, the same problem showed up: a quality management system running in
          spreadsheets, shared drives and email threads. Supplier certificates nobody could find on
          the day an auditor asked for them. Document versions drifted apart. Nobody could prove which
          approvals had happened.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-muted" data-reveal>
          We built Obel MS to be the document control and workflow system we kept wishing our clients
          already had. Now we offer it as a hosted service: we run it, back it up and maintain it, so
          a quality manager can get on with quality work instead of IT work.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-muted" data-reveal>
          Consulting is still what we do. If you need help implementing a QMS, preparing for
          an audit or training your team, that work continues alongside the software, often using
          Obel MS as the system it runs on.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-20 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-4 border-t border-line pt-10">
        <a href="/contact#demo" class="btn btn-primary">Book a 20-minute demo</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="link-u text-[15px] text-ink">Talk to us about consulting</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
